  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "65 single-family homes and 20 duplex units. Adjacent to 808 Alameda de las Pulgas (SMC-000138).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Plan set titled Vista Del Grande Estates. Owner on plans: Vista Del Grande San Carlos, LLC (contact Dennis Liu). County parcel layer shows Vista Del Grande San Carlos LLC owning 050-621-010 to -050 and VDG View Estate LLC owning 049-360-040, 049-372-010 and 050-220-140, all listed on the plan set.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003148",
        "SRC-001103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Project narrative (2025-05-30): site combines the Rolieri Property (house, abandoned greenhouse, agricultural structures) and the Ruiz Subdivision (one house); 75 structures as fee-simple lots under the Small Lot Single Unit Development guidelines; 65 single-unit homes and 10 duplex structures (20 units) to satisfy BMR; primary access via a shared private road to Alameda de las Pulgas through the adjoining property under a recorded mutual access easement with its owner (Veev); 22 units take access from Vista Del Grande and Coronado Ave; applicant requests the City quitclaim a slope easement.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Plan set: base density 6 du/ac = 74 units, 85 units with State Density Bonus; removal of 54 heritage trees and 3 significant trees; about 16,100 cubic yards of export; entitlements requested: Vesting Tentative Tract Map, Design Review, Conditional Use Permit (small lot development), CEQA review, Affordable Housing Plan, Transportation Management Plan, Tree Removal, Dirt Haul Permit; to be maintained by a homeowners association.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page lists 242 bedrooms in the single-family units and 52 in the duplex units, RS-6 zoning with Hillside Overlay, and planner Laura Richstone; status Awaiting resubmittal.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001231"
      ]
    }
  ],
